  <History Date="25-07-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="26-07-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed critical issue that was breaking the library (PIXEL.2 mode referenced UV and CyanAdditive attributes that didn't exist)" />
  <History Date="28-07-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." />
  <History Date="22-06-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added default RDM mode ID's (note SSP and PIXEL.1 modes won't work without proper Personality ID's)." />
